    <tr>
     <td valign="top">
      <table width="590" cellpadding="30" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" align="center" style="line-height: 1.3em;">
       <tr>
        <td valign="top">
<br>
         <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#f78d2c" size="4.5">
<Strong><center>You May Be Eligible For Additional Cash</center></Strong>
 <p><br>
              <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">
          Re: National Funding Agreement #{!Opportunity.Merchant_Number__c}
          <br>
          <br>
          We are pleased that we could help you in the past with financing for your business.  <em>Because of your continued timely payments, you may be eligible for additional funding</em>.
          <br>
          <strong><center>Just send me your last 6 months of bank statements.</center></strong>
          <p>
              <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#3e362a" size="3">
                In order to tell you how much you qualify for I will need <u>your recent 6 months of bank statements</u>.   Just email or fax me your statements at my contact information listed below.  You could get funds into your account in as little as 24 hours after I get your statements.  It's easy and quick.
                <br>
                <br>
                Call me at <font face="arial, sans-serif" color="#f78d2c"><strong>{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep_Phone__c}</strong> <font face="arial, sans-serif" color=#000000"> to discuss how we can help you get more cash.  Once I get your statements, I can let you know how much you could potentially qualify for.
                <br>
                <br>
                National Funding is dedicated to helping small businesses fill their cash needs.  Let us help you again.
                <br>
                <br>
                <br>
                <Strong>{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}</Strong>
                <br>
                Renewal Specialist | <a href="https://www.nationalfunding.com/?utm_source=Renewal%20Drip&utm_medium=Email&utm_content=HomeSig&utm_campaign=Renewal60Paid{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep__c}" style="color: #f78d2c; text-decoration: none;" target="_blank"><Strong>National Funding</Strong></a>
                <br>
{!Opportunity.NF_Renewal_Rep_Signature__c}
            </font>
            </p></td>
       </tr>
